=== Confederal government ===
{{See also|Castejón's commune districts}}
Castejón is the seat of all [[W:Separation of powers|three branches]] of the [[Confederal institution|confederal administration]]: the legislature ([[Confederal Congress]]), the executive ([[Secretariat Council (Balisca)|Secretariat Council]] led by the [[Secretary General of Balisca|Secretary General]]), and the judiciary ([[Confederal Council of Arbitration]]). Most confederal secretariats are concentrated in the [[Sol]] district in [[Hisbanya]], and the name ''Hisbanya'' is often used as a [[W:Metonymy|metonym]] for the [[Civil service of Balisca|Baliscan confederal civil service]]. Castejón has 121 [[Commune district|commune districts]] (16.4%) represented in the Confederal Congress, 22 of which were won by the insurgent [[Ilegalista]], 20 by the [[W:Localism|localist]] [[Mas!]] and the remainder by a coalition of cosmopolitan and [[W:YIMBY|YIMBY]]-aligned candidates and [[W:Platformism|platforms]] in the [[2024 Baliscan confederal election|2024 general election]].

